{"id":"a36c6cd41d04cbcf","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-simple-permitting.md","title":"简单集合的 permitting 构造","display":"thm-simple-permitting — 简单集合的 permitting 构造","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-simple-permitting","aliases":["20-thm-simple-permitting"],"display":"thm-simple-permitting — 简单集合的 permitting 构造","chapter":"5","section":"5.2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.2.7；Lemma 5.2.8","source_pdf_pages":[146,147],"source_printed_pages":[111,112],"depends_on":["[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-simple-permitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-simple-permitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-simple-permitting — 简单集合的 permitting 构造"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.2.7；Lemma 5.2.8"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>146</span><span>147</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>111</span><span>112</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"24856bb9ed3c13f4\" href=\"?note=24856bb9ed3c13f4\" title=\"20-df-bounded-reducibility\">20-df-bounded-reducibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\">\\(C\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s\">\\(C_s\\)</span> 是固定递增有限可计算枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 为统一阶段枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是待构造集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}\\)</span> 允许输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 查询至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，即 use 至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+1\">\\(x+1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"24856bb9ed3c13f4\" href=\"?note=24856bb9ed3c13f4\" title=\"20-df-bounded-reducibility\">20-df-bounded-reducibility</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}permitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land A\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}C].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}permitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land A\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}C].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0=\\varnothing\">\\(A_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span> 搜索最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e&lt;s\">\\(e&lt;s\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\">\\(W_{e,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing\\)</span>，且某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&gt;2e\">\\(x&gt;2e\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{s+1}\\upharpoonright(x+1)\\ne C_s\\upharpoonright(x+1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{s+1}\\upharpoonright(x+1)\\ne C_s\\upharpoonright(x+1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若存在，选最小这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。每个要求至多行动一次；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,2n]\">\\([0,2n]\\)</span> 中仍至多枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个成员，故补集无限。</p>\n<p>若某个无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 永不被击中，取所有较小要求最后行动之后的常数阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\">\\(s_0\\)</span>。计算严格递增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i&gt;2e\">\\(x_i&gt;2e\\)</span> 及严格递增阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i&gt;s_0\">\\(s_i&gt;s_0\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\\in W_{e,s_i}\">\\(x_i\\in W_{e,s_i}\\)</span>。若任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\ge s_i\">\\(t\\ge s_i\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{t+1}\">\\(C_{t+1}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i+1\">\\(x_i+1\\)</span> 以下变化，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 在该阶段符合条件，并且较小要求已不会行动，故其被选中，与假设矛盾。因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\upharpoonright(x_i+1)=C_{s_i}\\upharpoonright(x_i+1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\upharpoonright(x_i+1)=C_{s_i}\\upharpoonright(x_i+1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，有效寻找 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\\ge y\">\\(x_i\\ge y\\)</span> 并输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{s_i}(y)\">\\(C_{s_i}(y)\\)</span>，得到普通可计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_C\">\\(\\chi_C\\)</span>，矛盾。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s_0\">\\(e,s_0\\)</span> 是存在性反证中硬编码的有限常数，无须统一计算最后行动阶段。于是每个无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 被击中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 简单。</p>\n<p>最后给输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 查询整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,x]\">\\([0,x]\\)</span>，等到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s\">\\(C_s\\)</span> 与这些真实答案全部一致；单调枚举保证之后该前缀不变。任何后来把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 放入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的动作都要求此处再次变化，已不可能，故输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s(x)\">\\(A_s(x)\\)</span>。该程序在真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 下全停止，只查询至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}C\">\\(A\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}C\\)</span>；不要求对虚假的 oracle 答案也全停止。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 111–112 / PDF 146–147。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-bounded-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"24856bb9ed3c13f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-bounded-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"24856bb9ed3c13f4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"C_s","display":false},{"tex":"W_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}permitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\ [\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\land A\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}C].","display":true},{"tex":"A_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"e<s","display":false},{"tex":"W_{e,s}\\cap A_s=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"x>2e","display":false},{"tex":"W_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"C_{s+1}\\upharpoonright(x+1)\\ne C_s\\upharpoonright(x+1).","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"[0,2n]","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"s_0","display":false},{"tex":"x_i>2e","display":false},{"tex":"s_i>s_0","display":false},{"tex":"x_i\\in W_{e,s_i}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\ge s_i","display":false},{"tex":"C_{t+1}","display":false},{"tex":"x_i+1","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"C\\upharpoonright(x_i+1)=C_{s_i}\\upharpoonright(x_i+1).","display":true},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"x_i\\ge y","display":false},{"tex":"C_{s_i}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_C","display":false},{"tex":"e,s_0","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"[0,x]","display":false},{"tex":"C_s","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A_s(x)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_{\\mathrm{ibT}}C","display":false}],"bytes":2611,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["428fc565e7338639","24856bb9ed3c13f4","60af447f5d59a8dc","4ef1aee16db6b308"]}